            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ee, nine ne Yawe mpingwile ifintu fine (4) ifyakubonaula. Bakabepaya ku lupanga, imbwa eshikalatakanya ifitumbi fyabo, ifyuni nafyo fikalalya ifitumbi fyabo elyo ne finama fya mpanga fikalalya ifikalashalako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.1+2KI.21.2+2KI.21.3+2KI.21.4+2KI.21.5+2KI.21.6+2KI.21.7+2KI.21.8+2KI.21.9+2KI.21.10+2KI.21.11+2KI.21.12+2KI.21.13+2KI.21.14+2KI.21.15+2KI.21.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Isham 21:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.1+2CH.33.2+2CH.33.3+2CH.33.4+2CH.33.5+2CH.33.6+2CH.33.7+2CH.33.8+2CH.33.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Imila 33:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bonse aba pano isonde nkalenga bakaleitutuminafye ku mwenso pakumona ifi fintu, pa mulandu wa fintu ifibi ifyo Manase mwana Hesekia alecita mu Yerusalemu pa nshita aleteeka cino calo ca Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe ine nalishama! Nga cinshi ico mayo amfyalile ine? Ine ngumanafye no kubikana ifikansa na bantu bonse aba muli cino calo. Ine nshakongweshapo muntu indalama, kabili ine nshakongolapo ndalama ku muntu, nomba kabili abantu bonse nine baletipwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe asosa ati, “Cine cine nkakupususha pakuti ukacitepo icisuma. Cine cine nkalenga abalwani bobe bakapapate kuli iwe mu nshita sha macushi no bulanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teti pamoneke muntu uwingafuna icela, palibufi nga ni cilya cela cifuma ku kapinda ka ku kuso ico basakanyamo no mukuba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yawe nao anjeba ati, “Ine nkatuma abalwani abakwisa tapa ifyuma fya bantu bandi apafye, pamo na filya fine batutila, ekubalimuna pa mulandu wa fibi fyabo ifyo bacita muli cino calo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaleka bakalebombela abalwani babo mu calo cimo ico abantu bandi bashaishiba, pantu icipyu candi cilebilima ngo mulilo, kabili tacakatale acileka kubilima iyoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
